  era: "4th\u20136th c. CE \xB7 Section 10 \xB7 Gupta Empire \xB7 c. 319 \u2013 550 CE"
  title: Gupta administration
  text: Gupta kings took grand titles such as Maharajadhiraja, king of great kings. Provinces, called bhuktis, and districts, called vishayas, were run by officials; many posts became hereditary, and land grants to Brahmins and officials increased.
